      "explanation": "في الربع الرابع $\\sin\\theta = -\\dfrac{4}{5}$. 1) $\\sin 2\\theta = 2\\left(-\\dfrac{4}{5}\\right)\\left(\\dfrac{3}{5}\\right) = -\\dfrac{24}{25}$. 2) $\\cos 2\\theta = 2\\left(\\dfrac{3}{5}\\right)^2 - 1 = \\dfrac{18}{25} - 1 = -\\dfrac{7}{25}$. 3) $135^\\circ < \\dfrac{\\theta}{2} < 180^\\circ$ (الربع الثاني: $\\sin > 0$)، إذن $\\sin\\dfrac{\\theta}{2} = +\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1 - 3/5}{2}} = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{1}{5}} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$.",
